WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.912
Learn in your browser first: Learn in your browser first. You do not need to install anything for Module 1 online. Open Start Here and pick Python, C sharp, or A I. Mark steps done as you go — progress stays in this browser.

2
00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:31.402
When you want files on your computer: When you want files on your computer, open GitHub’s Code menu. Choose Download ZIP. Find the file in Downloads and unzip it. Git is optional — the ZIP is fine for beginners.

3
00:00:32.252 --> 00:00:46.028
Open the right folder: Open the right folder for your course. Python is in python-beginner-workbook. C sharp is in csharp-beginner-workbook. Start with each track’s Module 1 setup guide.

4
00:00:46.878 --> 00:00:59.670
Quick tip: Quick tip: if a download goes missing, check Help under Downloads. You can keep learning online while tools install. Guest mode works offline after pages load.
